' 图4-4 宿主、共享 Plugin API 与供应商插件的依赖图
' 实线：编译依赖或宿主内部调用。虚线：运行时加载。
@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 26
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam PackageBorderColor #4B4F51
skinparam PackageFontColor #222222
skinparam PackageFontStyle bold
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #4B4F51
skinparam RectangleFontColor #222222
skinparam LegendBorderColor #4B4F51
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam LegendFontColor #222222

package "宿主" #E8F5E9 {
  rectangle "微内核" as Core #E2E2F0
  rectangle "价格库存同步模块" as Sync #E2E2F0
  rectangle "插件运行时" as Runtime #E2E2F0
  rectangle "执行单持久化模块" as Store #E2E2F0
}

rectangle "PF4J 插件框架" as Pf4j #FFF3E0
rectangle "Plugin API\n共享契约" as Api #F3F0F7

package "供应商插件" #E3F2FD {
  rectangle "扩展实现" as Impl #E2E2F0
  rectangle "私有 SDK" as Sdk #E2E2F0
}

Core -down-> Store : 内部调用
Core -down-> Api : 编译依赖
Sync -down-> Api : 编译依赖
Runtime -down-> Api : 编译依赖
Runtime -down-> Pf4j : 编译依赖
Impl -up-> Api : 编译依赖\n并实现扩展点
Impl -right-> Sdk : 内部依赖
Runtime .down.> Impl : 运行时加载

legend bottom
  实线：编译依赖或宿主内部调用。
  虚线：仅插件运行时对扩展实现的运行时加载。
  宿主不编译依赖供应商实现。插件不依赖执行单持久化模块。私有 SDK 留在插件内部。
endlegend

@enduml
